    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Pearse Lodge B&B presents a rare opportunity to acquire a distinguished family-owned and operated guesthouse with a successful operational history dating back to 1994. This distinguished property boasts 10 bedrooms, functioning as a fully operational business with a dedicated and loyal customer base, including numerous repeat guests annually. Meticulously maintained and continually upgraded by the family owners, the property has seen several extensions and enhancements, including the installation of solar water heating systems and electricity panels, reflecting a commitment to sustainability and modern efficiency. The accommodation is precisely designed, with a clear delineation between private family living quarters and guest facilities. The owners’ accommodation features a well-appointed kitchen and breakfast area, a spacious living room with a feature stone fireplace and stove, utility facilities, a family bathroom, and three bedrooms, including a shower room. The guest accommodation comprises seven bedrooms, each with en-suite facilities, four on the ground floor and three on the first floor, offering guests privacy and comfort throughout their stay. The property’s communal areas include an inviting dining room, a reading and sitting room, and a sunlit garden room overlooking the gardens, creating an attractive and homely atmosphere. Externally, the property benefits from ample off-street parking, a dedicated storage compound, a separate bike shed, and independent gated rear access. The grounds are enclosed by a traditional stone boundary wall and feature beautifully maintained gardens, enhancing both privacy and aesthetic appeal. This outstanding property is situated within walking distance of Sligo Town Centre, Markievicz Park, local transport links, including bus and rail stations, as well as a variety of shops, restaurants, primary & secondary schools. Pearse Lodge offers exceptional versatility, as it can serve as a family home or be adapted for other residential care needs, providing flexibility to suit a range of future plans. This turnkey operation boasts an outstanding reputation, strong repeat business, and a genuine warm and welcoming setting. For further information or to arrange a viewing, please contact Oates Breheny Group at 071-9140404."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "PRIVATE ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\nFeature Entrance Porch (3.40m x 4.30m)\r\nEntrance also serves B&B, Tiled and wooden flooring, Wrap around windows, Solid wood door.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Breakfast area (2.75m x 6.95m)\r\nTiled floor, Fitted kitchen units, Integrated electric oven, hob and extractor fan, Built in storage cupboards, Feature Brick wall.\r\n\r\nLiving Room (4.83m x 6.23m)\r\nWooden floor, Feature stone fireplace with solid fuel stove and wooden mantal piece, access to bedrooms on first floor.\r\n\r\nUtility Room (3.40m x 3.10m)\r\nTiled floor, Plumbed for two washing machines and dryer, Built in Sliding wardrobes and storage units.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom (3.50m x 2.90m)\r\nTiled floor to ceiling, Wall panelling, Rain Shower. \r\n\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\nBedroom 1 (4.80m x 2.30m)\r\nDouble room, Wood floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (4.80m x 2.30m)\r\nDouble room, Wood floor.\r\n\r\nShower room (1.40m x 1.40m)\r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling, Mains shower, WC, WHB.\r\n\r\nOffice/Bedroom 3 (2.0m x 4.60m)\r\nSingle room, Wood floor.\r\n\r\nB&B ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\nDining Room (3.41m x 4.97m)\r\nWooden floor, Feature marble open fireplace with cast iron insert, Decorative coving to ceiling and centre rose, Large window to front garden.\r\n\r\nReading/Sitting room (3.30m x 2.50m)\r\nSolid wood floor, Double glass doors to Sunroom, Skylight to the ceiling, Access to lobby.\r\n\r\nSunroom/Garden room (3.35m x 5.80m)\r\nTiled floor, Double glass doors to garden area, Double skylights, Solid fuel stove with back boiler, Feature exposed stone wall.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1(Oak) (3.30m x 3.92m)\r\nDouble room, Carpet floor, Wall panelling, Wall lights, TV point.\r\n\r\nEn-suite and Storage (1.22m x 3.30m)\r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling, Mains shower, WC, WHB, Wood floor to storage area.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2(Hazel) (3.30m x 4.03m)\r\nDouble room, Mixed-material floor-carpet and wood, TV point.\r\n\r\nEn-suite (1.22m x 3.30m)\r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling, Mains shower, WC, WHB, Wood floor to storage area.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (Elm) (3.90m x 4.15m)\r\nDouble room, Wood floor, TV point.\r\n\r\nEn-suite (1.22m x 3.30m)\r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling, Mains shower, WC, WHB, Wood floor to storage area.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 (Beech) (4.33m x 4.80m)\r\nDouble room, Wood floor, Raised lounge area, Dual doors.\r\n\r\nEn-suite (2.80m x 1.62m)\r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling, Mains shower, Feature glass block shower wall, WC, WHB.\r\n\r\nEntrance porch/Storage area (1.6m x 1.8m) \r\nWood floor, Storage space.\r\n\r\nB&B ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 5 (Poppy) (3.16m x 3.74m)\r\nDouble room, Carpet floor, Built in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nEn-suite (2.30m x 1.20m)\r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling, WC, WHB, Mains shower fitted with a hot water pump.\r\n\r\nLarge storage room\r\n\r\nBedroom 6 (Lily) (4.53m x 2.90m)\r\nDouble room, Carpet floor, Built in sliding wardrobes.\r\n\r\nEn-suite (1.3m x 1.3m)\r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling, WC, WHB, Mains shower fitted with a hot water pump.\r\n\r\nBedroom 7 (Daisy) (2.3m x 2.84m)\r\nDouble room, Wood floor.\r\n\r\nEn-suite (1.37m x 1.40m)\r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling, WC, WHB, Mains shower fitted with a hot water pump."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Dual central heating-Oil fired and back boiler.\r\nDouble and triple glazed windows.\r\nB&B rooms all fitted with fire doors.\r\nAll B&B rooms have en-suites.\r\nLarge storage areas throughout house,\r\nPrivate living quarters featuring full accommodation.\r\nSide vehicular access to rear of property.\r\nOff street parking for up to 9 cars.\r\nSolar panels and solar water heaters fitted to the roof.\r\nLarge rear garden area.\r\nPrivate storage compound with large shed.\r\nTown central location nearby all essential amenities such as transport routes, healthcare facilities, schools, recreational parks and Sligo Town Centre."
      },
